~ rootkit
do GameDialogueManager.pause_game(true)
#[The ground of the battlefield cracked suddenly]
RootKit: B4CKd00r_EST4BLISH3D.
#[RootKit digs a tunnel beneath the battlefield]
Player: Where did it go?
Odysseus: It created a path. Not just for itself. Others can enter and use that route.
Player: Now they can attack underneath too?
Odysseus: They are learning. *Smirk*
#function to activate rootkit pop-up card
do GameDialogueManager.show_enemy("rootkit", 9)
=> END

~ sql
do GameDialogueManager.pause_game(true)
SQL Injection: PARSING_DATABASE.
Player: Did that thing just skip half of the path!?
Odysseus: SQL Injection.
Odysseus: it is a cyberattack where malicious SQL code is inserted into vulnerable input fields.
Odysseus: That thing exploits weaknesses and bypasses security checkpoints, instead of attacking defenses directly.
Player: Too easy.
#function to activate sql injection pop-up card
do GameDialogueManager.show_enemy("sql", 10)
=> END

